From: NodeByte Browser Authors <dev@nodebyte.cn>
Subject: [PATCH 0220] JS/WS/WS-under-HTTPS policy gates and fingerprint injection points

内核策略执行点（提示词 5.8 / 5.6）：
1. CustomAllowJavaScript → blink settings javascript_enabled
2. CustomAllowWebSockets + 白/黑名单 → websocket_manager.cc 建连前拦截（第一层）
3. CustomAllowWsUnderHttps → mixed_content_checker.cc ShouldBlockWebSocket 放行分支；
   websocket_manager.cc 做第二层黑名单校验（双层防 JS 绕过）
4. 指纹注入：resource_request.cc 请求头改写 + navigator_base.cc 返回值 + WebGL 噪声
5. Cookie 会话集：ResourceRequest 层注入 / Set-Cookie 回写（0130 模块钩子挂点）

⚠️ 基线：Chromium 128 ——【需核实】以下每处签名与文件布局。
⚠️ 网站黑白名单（SiteBlocklist/SiteAllowlist）复用原生 URLBlocklist；此处只处理 Custom*。

--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/settings.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/settings.cc
@@
   // NodeByte: global JavaScript gate enforced by CustomAllowJavaScript
   // (mandatory → policy forces the settings toggle disabled in UI too).
+  SetJavaScriptEnabled(nodebyte::ReadPolicyBool(
+      nodebyte::policy_keys::kAllowJavaScript, true));
--- a/services/network/websocket/websocket_manager.cc
+++ b/services/network/websocket/websocket_manager.cc
@@
+  // NodeByte layer 1: global switch + allow/block lists.
+  if (!nodebyte::IsWebSocketAllowed(url)) {
+    OnConnectionClosedForWebSocket(  // 拒绝建连
+        "blocked_by_nodebyte_policy");
+    return;
+  }
+  // Layer 2 (mixed content ws:// under https) is enforced in
+  // MixedContentChecker + re-validated here for defense in depth.
+  if (!nodebyte::IsWebSocketMixedContentAllowed(url, origin)) {
+    OnConnectionClosedForWebSocket("ws_over_https_blocked");
+    return;
+  }
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/loader/mixed_content_checker.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/loader/mixed_content_checker.cc
@@
 bool MixedContentChecker::ShouldBlockWebSocket(
     const KURL& url,
     MixedContentChecker::ConsoleReportingIssue reporting_issue) {
+  // NodeByte: policy may explicitly allow ws:// under HTTPS with optional
+  // host allowlist (提示词 5.8.3: 强烈不建议无白名单全局放开).
+  if (nodebyte::IsWebSocketMixedContentAllowed(url, SecurityOrigin())) {
+    return false;
+  }
   return ShouldBlockFetch(...) /* 原逻辑 */;
--- a/services/network/public/cpp/resource_request.cc
+++ b/services/network/public/cpp/resource_request.cc
@@
   // NodeByte fingerprint: rewrite UA / Accept-Language / Accept / Referer
   // from the active FingerprintTemplate (per-device, synced as encrypted
   // config). Store access via nodebyte::FingerprintProfile (0140).
+  nodebyte::ApplyFingerprintToRequest(*this);
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/navigator_base.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/navigator_base.cc
@@
   // NodeByte fingerprint: navigator.webdriver / platform /
   // hardwareConcurrency return the simulated values when a template is
   // active. TCP/IP is NOT spoofable here (needs proxy), hardware IDs from
   // OS remain — limits are surfaced in UI (提示词 5.6.5).
+  if (nodebyte::HasActiveFingerprintTemplate()) {
+    return nodebyte::SimulatedPlatform();
+  }
